      "content": "that makes sense. but can u go a bit deeper on the \"legally flawed\" part? like, beyond just saying the right wasn't established, what are the specific legal or logical errors the majority pointed out in the dissent's reasoning? i need to be able to explain why the dissent's logic doesn't hold up under the majority's framework for my seminar.",
